nix1e
=====

A flake to make NixOS work just a bit better on the Surface Laptop 7.

This was created by slowly reimplementing portions of the flake made by scuggo.
The following is a list of notable changes from scuggo's flake. Do keep in mind
that some things build upon previously mentioned changes

- ec_reboot was removed in favor of a reboot hook to hard reset as a result of
  any regular kernel restart/reboot.
- Swapped the spi-hid driver for a patched-up version of a newer series
  submitted by Chromium and slightly modified the devicetree to accomodate the
  changes. *This properly powered the trackpad and solved suspend issues.*
